OL,3,GNEWSAMan took and shared selfies with
OL,4,Aillegal guns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who took and shared pictures of
OL,7,Fhimself holding illegal guns has been
OL,8,Fjailed for six years.
OL,10,FTyler Davidson, 30, took selfies with
OL,11,Fweapons and sent "bravado" laden
OL,12,Fmessages in which he said he would do a
OL,13,F"Raoul Moat", Teesside Crown Court
OL,14,Fheard.
OL,16,FHis DNA was found on a pistol
OL,17,Fdiscovered in a car and a sawn-off
OL,18,Fshotgun hidden in a bag in woodland,
OL,19,Fwith Davidson saying he was looking
OL,20,Fafter the weapons for others.
